 "coaching_points": [
  "Warm up first \u2014 2-3 min light jog, neck rolls, shoulder circles, two gentle nod-headers of a held ball",
  "Soft underhand tosses from 6m, lofted to the forehead \u2014 never drilled flat at the defender",
  "Attack the ball at your highest point \u2014 meet it, don't wait for it; clear high and WIDE through the gate, back upfield toward the server, never across your own goal",
  "Read the flight early: scan the ball out of the server's hands, get your body under it, plant and spring off the ground",
  "Use the forehead not the crown, tense the neck, mouth closed \u2014 cushion nothing, drive through the ball",
  "12 headers total (2 sides x 6) stays under the youth heading cap \u2014 the jog back to the working cone is your rest",
  "Success: 8 of 12 clearances punched through a wide gate with good height",
  "Progression: server steps back to 8m and varies the side; regression: catch and throw the ball clear instead of heading"
 ],
 "variations": [
  "Contested \u2014 an attacker leans on the defender's back so they must clear under pressure",
  "Alternate sides \u2014 call the target gate late so the defender reads and reacts"
 ],
